# Admin · 亲子任务（依赖 ../_login.http）

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tasks?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/stats?start_date=2026-03-01&end_date=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新建（class_id 换成本地班级）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "每日阅读10分钟",
  "description": "测试",
  "class_id": 1,
  "frequency": "daily",
  "start_date": "2026-04-01",
  "end_date": "2026-04-30",
  "points": 5
}
